# BAS @[[all T1 T2]] annotation syntax: two-element intersection via Expr::Call path.
# [all Int Number] parses as Expr::Call { func: VarRef("all"), args: [Int, Number], implied: true }.
# normalize_intersection([Int, Number]) — Int is a subtype of Number in BAS, produces
# Type::Intersection([Int, Number]). The value 42 matches both Int and Number, so it passes.
[@[[all Int Number]] 42]
=== out
Int(42)
